/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80016a20_FUN_80016a20.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `a`: object whose embedded descriptor supplies the `r12` interface.
/// - `b`: receiver forwarded to the dispatched method.
