const DAT_80353A64: usize = 0x8035_3A64;

/// Hands one child's current digit to the active manager group.
///
/// The child's virtual slot `+0x6C` (vtable at `child + 0x60`) answers the
/// current digit byte. When that byte is not `0xFF`, it is stored into
/// `this + 0x670 + digit` and mirrored at `this + 0x674`. The button state
/// `+0x680` is forced to `3` first, and the caller's mode byte is written to
/// `+0x68D`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80020ed0` at `0x80020ED0` (112 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80020ed0_FUN_80020ed0.c`
///
