/// - `this`: manager object (digit group `+0x670`, mirror `+0x674`, button
///   state `+0x680`, mode `+0x68D`).
/// - `child`: record whose `+0x60` vtable exposes the digit at `+0x6C`.
/// - `mode`: value copied to `+0x68D`.
