///   `+0x68D = 3`, and answers `2`.
/// - **Button state `3`.** Copies `+0x670..+0x673` to `+0x694`/`+0x284`, sets
///   `+0x68D = 2`, and answers `1`, or `3` when `+0x64C` is non-zero.
