/// `0` when no group was selected, `1`/`3` for the first and third groups, or
/// `2` for the button-state-`2` group.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the selected digit, its mirror and the mode byte.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be readable and writable through `+0x694`.
