/// calls method `+0xC` with `child` in `r3`. A non-zero answer returns the
/// *parent* node; a zero answer descends into the child. After five in-frame
/// steps the body recurses on the sixth child, so the walk continues without a
/// per-frame limit but each frame consumes at most five links.
