/// words must point at an object with a readable vtable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the body is a five-fold unrolled
/// `lwz r3,0x30(r31)` / `lwz r12,0(r3)` / `lwz r12,0xc(r12)` / `bcctr` /
/// `cmpi` / `beq` with a `bl 0x8002a940` tail, and the two return arms are
/// `mr r3,r31` at `0x8002AA00`/`0x8002AA08`.
