/// Advances the `+0x544` emitter and latches the animation-finished word.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8002b510` at `0x8002B510` (124 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8002b510_FUN_8002b510.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: record with the emitter at `+0x544`, the animation at `+0x584`,
///   the latch at `+0x5D0` and the mode at `+0x5CC`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One virtual call, one `0x80169020` probe, one latch write and - in mode `3`
/// only - one virtual `+0xD4` notification.
///
/// # Safety
/// The `+0x544` vtable and the `+0x584` animation record must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - `lwz r12,0x544(r3)` / `lwz r12,0x1c(r12)` / `addi r3,r3,0x544` /
/// `bcctr`, `bl 0x80169020`, `li r3,1` / `stw r3,0x5d0(r31)`,
/// `cmpi cr0,0,r0,3` and the `+0xD4` tail are literal.
