// | `0x8002BDE0` | `0x802DCBFC` forward with the interface at `a + 0x18` |
// | `0x8002BE10` | `0x802DCBFC` forward with the interface at `a + 0x24` |
// | `0x8002BE60` | bind `"dokan_attack"` to the `+0x544` model, scale `+0x584`, zero its alpha |
// | `0x8002C370` | full actor destructor (animation player, model, animation, layout, base) |
// | `0x8002C7F0` | deleting-destructor wrapper (twin of `0x8002A740`) |
// | `0x8002C850` | static-record accessor `0x8035330C` |
// | `0x8002C860` | static-record accessor `0x803532CC` |
//
// Object map observed across the tick pair and the animation binder (the same
// layout the wave-204 door lanes use):
