// | offset | type | role |
// |---|---|---|
// | `+0x60` | `u32` | owner vtable (slots `+0xD4`, `+0x298`, `+0x2A8`, `+0x2AC`) |
// | `+0x524` | `0x1C`-byte record | layout buffer |
// | `+0x540` | `u32` | layout archive handle |
// | `+0x544` | `0x2C`-byte record | primary model record (has its own vtable) |
// | `+0x5CC` | `u32` | warning/state counter (`1`/`2` arm the notify) |
// | `+0x5D4` | `u32` | state word, non-zero enables the notify |
// | `+0x600` | record | animation player |
// | `+0x584` | `0x2C`-byte record | secondary model record / animation |
//
// The animation name at `0x80303A80` is the second `"dokan_attack"` copy in the
// image (the first is `0x803030C4`, used by the wave-204 door builders); it
// sits next to `"dead_leaf"` in a different name table, so this binder belongs
// to the leaf/door actor pair rather than to the plain door builder.
