/// address (`lis r4,0x8035` / `addi r4,r4,0x3090`), so it is a BSS object, not a
/// string. It lies in the `0x80351680..0x80427680` BSS segment (zero-filled,
/// both `p_filesz = 0` and `p_memsz = 0xD6000`).
const DAT_80353090_B: usize = 0x8035_3090;

/// `0x8035_3010`: the other BSS-resident state record of the pair, handed to
/// virtual `+0xD4` by [`fn_8002b780`].
const DAT_80353010_B: usize = 0x8035_3010;

/// `0x8030_3A80`: `"dokan_attack"`, the animation bound by [`fn_8002be60`].
