/// - Ghidra: none - no row/export for `0x8002D090`.
/// - Extent: `0x8002D090..0x8002D0C0` (48 bytes), immediately before
///   [`fn_8002d0c0`].
/// - Table: slot 3 of the `0x803030FC` vtable (word `0x80303110`, offset
///   `+0x0C`).
/// - Evidence: `lwz r12,+0x60` / `lwz r12,+0x98` / `mtctr` / `bcctr`, then
///   `li r3,1` and the epilogue.
///
/// # Arguments
