/// Vtable slot 61 of `0x803030FC` (`0x803031F8`): contact dispatcher, mode `1`.
///
/// The shared predicate `0x800964A0(this, other, event, 1)` is asked first; a
/// zero answer then runs the base contact reply `0x80095C80(this, other,
/// event)`. This is the same two-call shape as the `dEn_c` slot-60/61 bodies in
/// `game::enemies`, without the per-class veto.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no row/export for `0x8002D420`.
/// - Extent: `0x8002D420..0x8002D480` (96 bytes); [`fn_8002d480`] follows
///   after four zero bytes.
/// - Table: slot 61 of the `0x803030FC` vtable (word `0x803031F8`, offset
///   `+0xF4`).
/// - Evidence: `li r6,1` before `bl 0x800964A0`, the `cmpi r3,0` /
///   `bc 4,2` guard, and the three-register reload before `bl 0x80095C80`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor.
/// - `other`: contact request word forwarded unchanged.
/// - `event`: event record forwarded unchanged.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One predicate and, on zero, one base reply.
