/// # Side effects
/// One optional counter reload, one decrement, one predicate and possibly two
/// class virtuals.
///
/// # Safety
/// The class vtable must carry the `+0x2E0`, `+0x9C` and `+0xD4` slots.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the timer arithmetic, guards and descriptor are literal.
