/// ticks the `+0x6E0` record, `+0xE8..+0xF0` are zeroed, the counter `+0x6A4`
/// becomes `20`, the manager `+0x394` `+0x2C` slot is queried for
/// [`B262_DESC_80358004`], and when it answers non-zero `+0x740` is loaded from
/// `B262_TABLE_802EE500[(*(this + 4) & 3)]`. Finally the `+0x6C0` angle and
/// `+0x360` state word are initialised.
