///   after eight zero bytes.
/// - Table: slot 173 of the `0x803030FC` vtable (word `0x803033B8`, offset
///   `+0x2B4`).
/// - Evidence: `lwz r12,+0x60` / `+0x2D8` / `bcctr`, the second `+0x98`
///   group, and the `stw 0,+0x274` / `sth 0,+0x102` pair.
