/// Releases the `+0x544` sub-object, advances the signed `+0x100` angle by
/// `+2048` and triggers the notice effect.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row or export for `0x80025BD0`.
/// - Extent: 104 bytes, `0x80025BD0..0x80025C38`; the next table start is
