/// Runs the two-phase timed state machine of the `+0x360` word.
///
/// Prologue: the `+0x544` release slot, `0x8006CDE0`, `0x800955F0`. While the
/// `+0x300` slot answers `0`, `0x80072BC0(+0x1EC)` may arm the walk flag and
/// zero `+0xE8..+0xF0`; `0x8006FA40(+0x1EC, NULL)` re-zeroes `+0xE8`. Then:
///
/// - **phase 1** - the `+0x2C8` limit is read and the `+0x584` elapsed time is
///   compared against it; once it is at least the limit, slot `+0x2EC` runs and
///   the phase becomes `2`.
/// - **phase 2** - the `+0x2CC` limit is handed to `0x801690E0`; non-zero runs
///   slot `+0x2F0`. Otherwise the elapsed time is compared again: short of the
///   limit `0x80024190` rebuilds the segment and `+0x2E8` runs; past it
///   `0x80169020` gates the `+0x6F0` counter, positive values re-arm through
///   `+0x28C`, and expiry hands `0x80352BB4` to `+0xD4` when the walk flag is
///   set.
///
/// The sibling `0x80025800` is the same machine with a `+0x6F0` base; this body
/// is its `+0x360`-phase twin and additionally zeroes the three translation
/// words only in the `+0x300 == 0` arm.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row or export for `0x800252F0`.
/// - Extent: 500 bytes, `0x800252F0..0x800254E4`; the next table start is
///   `0x800254F0`, so there are 12 zero bytes.
/// - Table: slot 162 of `0x8030241C` (word `0x803026A4`, offset `+0x290`).
/// - observed: `stfd f31` / `psq_st f31` frame; `bl 0x8006CDE0`,
///   `bl 0x800955F0`; `lwz r12,r30+0x60` / `+0x300`;
///   `bl 0x80072BC0`; `bl 0x8006FA40`; `cmpi r0,1` / `cmpi r0,2` over
///   `+0x360`; `fmr f31,f1` after the `+0x2C8`/`+0x2CC` slots;
///   `cror 2,1,2` + `bc 4,2`; `bl 0x80168080`; `bl 0x801690E0` with `f1`;
///   `bl 0x80024190`; `addic. +0x6F0`; `addi r4,r4,11188` (`0x80352BB4`).
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: scene; phase `+0x360`, counter `+0x6F0`, translation
///   `+0xE8..+0xF0`, chain `+0x1EC`, player `+0x584`, sub-object `+0x544`,
///   vtable `+0x60`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Nine virtual slots, three translation stores, one phase store and one
/// counter store.
