/// Resets the model chain, then selects between the release record and the
/// animation-end slot.
///
/// While `+0x300` answers `0`, `0x80072BC0(+0x1EC)` zeroes `+0xEC` and
/// `0x8006FA40(+0x1EC, NULL)` copies `+0xB8..+0xC0` to `+0xAC..+0xB4` (the
/// stored target back into the position). `0x80169020(+0x584)` then decides:
/// a finished animation hands `0x80352C74` to `+0xD4`, otherwise the `+0x2F8`
/// slot runs only when the `+0x584` elapsed time is exactly `7.0`.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
