// ===========================================================================
// Wave 262, lane D (`_D262`): twin `0x80303AA4` / `0x80303F50` vtables,
// the six remaining prologue bodies and the uncovered leaves
// ===========================================================================
//
// `0x80303AA4` (183 words) and `0x80303F50` (182 words) are the `pakkun`
// base/derived pair decoded by wave-261 lane D in the `_D261` section above.
// That pass left 27 and 28 uncovered slots respectively, six of them
// prologue-shaped. This section lands those six, every uncovered non-prologue
// leaf of both tables, and the shared helper `0x8002BF60`, so both censuses
// read `uncovered=0`.
