// Re-measured twin shape (`work/wave262/d_census.mjs`): the arrays share 166
// words at the same slot index and differ in **16** slots (`+0x40`, `+0x22C`,
// `+0x278..+0x2A4`, `+0x2C4`, `+0x2D0`); 17 targets are unique to
// `0x80303AA4` and 16 to `0x80303F50`. The `_D261` header's "differs in 17
// slots" counts those 16 differences plus the null word at `+0x2DC`.
//
// `0x8002BF60` is not a table word: it is the shared tail that `0x8002C120`
// and `0x8002C2A0` branch into. It is translated here so both cross-references
// stay as calls instead of address constants.
//
// `no_std`; every callee is reached by address or by its translated sibling.

