/// Posts positional effect `0x173` at the scene position.
///
/// Sequence (observed):
/// 1. `0x8006CED0(&position, this)` writes the position plus the actor's
///    per-frame offset;
/// 2. `0x80069530(slot)` answers the sound/effect mask word;
