/// Writes the four scalar values of a shell reset and selects the per-side
/// `+0xF4` lift.
///
/// Sequence (observed): `+0x11C = 0.15f`, `+0x7CC = 0`, digit slot `16`, then
/// `+0xF4 = {3.0, -3.0}[+0x348]` (read with `lfsx` from `0x8042B5A8`).
///
/// # Original
