/// The `+0x394` owner chain answers through slot `+0x28`; the owner is then
/// asked slot `+0x14` with `0x80353CA8`. The `neg/or/rlwinm` normalization
/// reduces that answer to `!= 0`, and only the **non-zero** case enters the
/// `+0x60 -> +0xD4` state switch with `0x80353DA8`.
