///   `addi r3,r3,0x5F0` / `bl 0x8008C2C0` at `0x8003CDF4`/`0x8003CDF8`;
///   `mr r3,r30`/`mr r4,r31`/`bl 0x80095480` at `0x8003CDFC..0x8003CE04`.
