///   when the side is *not* `1`); `lfs f0,-0x7BA8(r2)` (`0.0`) / `fcmpu cr0,1,0` /
///   `bc 12,1,0x80031760` (`bgt` to the dispatch when the value is positive);
///   `cmpi cr0,0,r0,0` / `bclr 4,2` (`0x4C820020`, return when the side is not
///   `0`); `lfs f0,-0x7BA8(r2)` / `fcmpu cr0,1,0` / `bclr 4,0`
///   (`0x4C800020`, return unless the value is negative); then
///   `lwz r12,0x60(r3)` / `lwz r12,0x2CC(r12)` / `mtspr CTR,r12` /
///   `bcctr 20,0` at `0x8003176C`.
