///   `addi r5,r1,0x10` / `addi r6,r30,0x524` / `li r7,0` /
///   `bl 0x801650D0`;
///   `addi r3,r30,0x540` / `addi r4,r13,-32232` / `bl 0x8023A200` /
///   `stw r3,0x5BC(r30)` / `stw r3,0x8(r1)` / `addi r4,r1,0xC` /
///   `addi r5,r1,0x8` / `addi r6,r30,0x524` / `addi r3,r30,0x5C0` /
///   `li r7,0` / `li r8,1` / `stw r31,0xC(r1)` / `bl 0x80166830`; epilogue
///   restores `r31`/`r30` and returns.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor; `+0x524` is the name buffer, `+0x540` the archive, and
///   `+0x544`/`+0x584`/`+0x5BC`/`+0x5C0` the four model/clip records.
