//   `src/boot/init_tables.rs`, `fn_80030ab0`). So the 173 slots end exactly at
//   the next data object, not on a zero word inside the table.
// * Kind: **vtable**, not a dispatch table. All 173 words are distinct
//   (`distinct 173/173`), none is zero and none points back into the run
//   (`target-containment 0.00`); there is no repeated case handler, and the
//   targets cover many different code bands (`0x8001D1C0..0x80162xxx`).
