//   - `0x80A8F5C0`/`0x80A8F5C8`/`0x80A8F5CC` in `FUN_80a8f590`;
//   - `0x80A8FD00`/`0x80A8FD08`/`0x80A8FD0C` in `FUN_80a8fcd0`;
//   - `0x80A90B70`/`0x80A90B78`/`0x80A90B7C` in `FUN_80a90b40`.
//   Each constructor allocates a `0x780`-byte actor (`0x778` in
//   `FUN_80a90b40`), installs this base table at `+0x60`, then overwrites
//   `+0x60` with its own REL table (`0x80B4FB18`, `0x80B4FDF0`, `0x80B500F0`,
