///   `stw r0,0x74(r1)` / `stw r31,0x6C(r1)` / `lfs f1,0xB0(r3)` /
///   `lwz r0,0x764(r3)` / `fsubs f2,f1,f0` / `lfs f3,0xB4(r3)` /
///   `lfs f0,0xAC(r3)` / `cmpi cr0,r0,1` / three `stfs` to `0x14`/`0x18`/
///   `0x1C(r1)` / `bc 4,2` skip / `lfs f0,-0x7BD8(r2)` (`44.0`) /
///   `fsubs f0,f1,f0` / `stfs f0,0x18(r1)`; then `li r6,0`, the eleven
///   zero `stw r6` of the record tail, `li r0,1` / `stw r0,0x20(r1)`,
///   `lfs f6/f5/f4` from `0x14`/`0x18`/`0x1C(r1)`, `lfs f3/f2/f1` from
///   `-0x7BD4`/`-0x7BD0`/`-0x7BCC(r2)`, `lfs f0,-0x7C14(r2)` (`0.0`),
///   the six `stfs` that materialise words `1..6`, `addi r3,r3,0x484` /
///   `addi r4,r1,0x20` / `li r5,1` / `bl 0x800B8700`, `or r31,r3,r3`,
///   `addi r3,r1,0x20` / `li r5,0x3C` / `addi r4,0x80024C20` / `li r6,1` /
///   `bl 0x802DCA98`, `or r3,r31,r31`, epilogue.
///
