///   `0x803054AC`, offset `+0x170` from the header (`+0x168` from the array)
/// - Reach: `vcall(actor, 0x168)` through the `+0x60` vtable
/// - Not in `functions.tsv`; no Ghidra export
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor; `+0x100`/`+0x102` the two animators, `+0x348` the
///   owner side and `+0x459` the side index.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
