/// One virtual call on `+0x548`, two halfword updates, two shared updates and,
/// when `+0x391` is zero, the `0x80097170` position update on `+0xAC`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `+0x548` must hold a live vtable and the byte fields must be readable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the `-768` addend, the `{256,-256}` table at `0x8042B568`, the
/// equality test and the `+0x391` guard are literal; the twin is
/// [`fn_8002e440`], which reads the same-shaped `{256,-256}` pair at
