///   word `0x80035DC0` is the tabled body [`fn_80035dc0`])
/// - Table: slot 147 of `0x8030533C` (header; method array `0x80305344`), word
///   `0x80305590`, offset `+0x254` from the header (`+0x24C` from the array)
/// - Reach: `vcall(actor, 0x24C)` through the `+0x60` vtable
/// - Not in `functions.tsv`; no Ghidra export
///
/// The first incoming word is unused: the body moves `r4` into `r3` and drives
/// the *second* argument. The call is the same six-operand shape as
/// [`fn_80021470`], but with the mode word `2` in the last slot.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `_owner`: incoming `r3`, never read.
/// - `actor`: the record published at the stage global's `+0x138`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One virtual `+0x400` call and the scene latch `+0x138 = 1`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor + 0x60` must hold a vtable with a callable `+0x400` slot, and
/// `0x80429F10` must hold a live scene manager.
