/// # Confidence
/// high - the `0x8042B560` (`0.2815f`) addend, the `+0x10C` float, the
/// `0x8042B564` (`0.8125f`) multiplier, the `(1, 0, 2)` integer triple and the
/// scene store are literal; the twin is [`fn_80021470`].
