/// the normalised position; the **second** angle is written through
/// `0x8016EDD0`, then the `(0, 16, 0)` offset at `0x8042B548`/`0x8042B54C` is
/// concatenated into `+0x7C` with `0x801C0540`; the **first** angle goes
