/// `0x8042B550` is concatenated the same way; the **third** angle goes through
/// `0x8016EEF0`.
/// observed: the `+0x548` animator finally receives the record
/// (`0x8016A170`), the `+0xDC` source (`0x8016A150`) and the frame/state `0`
/// (`0x8016A1A0`).
