/// The layout at `+0x14` is cleared through [`FN_800C9500`] and its channel `1`
/// is started with the "no seek" offset through [`FN_800C92F0`]. The scene's
/// state word at `+0x1BC` is then set to `1` (the "armed" value read by
/// [`fn_8001b580`]) and [`fn_8001b620`] runs the per-frame follow pass.
///
