/// - Extent: `0x8001B8D0..0x8001B920` (80 bytes, 19 instructions), ending at
///   the `blr` at `0x8001B91C`; one zero word precedes it at `0x8001B8CC` and
///   the next body starts at `0x8001B920` ([`fn_8001b920`]).
/// - Reach: no `b` or `bl` in the executable segments targets it. The one data
///   word naming it, `0x802EE040`, is the callback word (`+0x08`) of record 0
///   of the twelve-byte table at `0x802EE038`; the record's first two words
///   are `0`/`-1`, so the start is not a pointer-run interior.
/// - Observed: `stwu r1,-0x10(r1)`; `mflr r0`; `stw r0,0x14(r1)`;
///   `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `mr r31,r3`; `addi r3,r3,0x14`; `bl 0x800C9500`;
///   `addi r3,r31,0x14`; `li r4,1`; `li r5,0`; `bl 0x800C92F0`;
///   `li r0,1`; `901F01BC stw r0,0x1BC(r31)`; `mr r3,r31`;
///   `bl 0x8001B620`; epilogue; `4E800020 bclr 20,0` (blr).
///
/// # Arguments
