///   `li r4,2`; `li r5,0`; `bl 0x800C92F0`; `b` over the second arm;
///   `addi r3,r31,0x14`; `li r4,1`; `li r5,0`; `bl 0x800C92F0`;
///   `li r0,1`; `stw r0,0x1B4(r31)`; epilogue; `4E800020 blr`.
/// - Polarity: `bt cr0.eq` takes the `false` arm, so a non-zero predicate
///   selects channel `2` and a zero predicate channel `1`.
/// - Evidence: `work/wave287/e_dis2.txt`, `work/wave287/e_ops.txt`,
///   `work/wave287/e_refs.txt`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: wipe scene whose `+0x14` layout and `+0x1B4` word are live.
